Bind Npc 29072 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29073 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 805 "[Crack of All Means] Finding the Crack"
    Journal for karus "You must follow [Advisor] Herga's order."
    Journal for elmorad "You must follow [Advisor] Nez's order."
    Collect 1 of 900334000

Requires player level >= 59 and quest 804 is completed

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Oh no! Master! It was worse than what we had imagined. Let's go meet Harrigon at [Ronarkland]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Oh no! Master! It was worse than what we had imagined. Let's go meet Marcus at [Ronarkland]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Hello~ You're back! You seem tired."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "[Cracking Experiment Report]? That was the issue. But a crack?  Something must have had happened.\n\nFollowing the order from Herga, deliver [Cracking Test Report] to Harrigon."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Hello~ You're back! You seem tired."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "[Cracking Experiment Report]? That was the issue. But a crack?  Something must have had happened.\n\nFollowing the order from Nez, deliver [Cracking Test Report] to Marcus."

On in_progress
    Say "So where is it?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Hm... I see.. That's why.\n\nThe answer is to get rid of the main culprit. I'm asking you to do this, <selfname>. Destroy [Crack] and it's main culprit. And come back."
